{"page":236,"width":1871,"height":2643,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"62.1 너비 우선 탐색","words":[{"text":"62.1","x":211,"y":182,"width":102,"height":42},{"text":"너비","x":349,"y":177,"width":78,"height":53},{"text":"우선","x":445,"y":180,"width":84,"height":51},{"text":"탐색","x":547,"y":181,"width":81,"height":51}]},{"text":"그래프에서 너비 우선 탐색(BF국. seatch)은 시작 정점을 경계(jronuer)에 추가하는 것","words":[{"text":"그래프에서","x":212,"y":306,"width":163,"height":40},{"text":"너비","x":394,"y":308,"width":60,"height":38},{"text":"우선","x":472,"y":309,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"탐색(BF국.","x":553,"y":309,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"seatch)은","x":888,"y":312,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"시작","x":1035,"y":313,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"정점을","x":1116,"y":312,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"경계(jronuer)에","x":1227,"y":312,"width":217,"height":39},{"text":"추가하는","x":1461,"y":312,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"것","x":1614,"y":311,"width":31,"height":37}]},{"text":"으로 시작합니다. 경계는 이전에 방문했던 정점들에 의해 구성됩니다. 그리고 현재 경계에 인접한","words":[{"text":"으로","x":212,"y":382,"width":67,"height":30},{"text":"시작합니다.","x":291,"y":380,"width":171,"height":39},{"text":"경계는","x":480,"y":382,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"이전에","x":590,"y":382,"width":93,"height":38},{"text":"방문했던","x":698,"y":382,"width":126,"height":39},{"text":"정점들에","x":839,"y":383,"width":124,"height":38},{"text":"의해","x":979,"y":385,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"구성됩니다.","x":1054,"y":384,"width":170,"height":39},{"text":"그리고","x":1241,"y":384,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"현재","x":1352,"y":384,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"경계에","x":1432,"y":386,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"인접한","x":1545,"y":382,"width":103,"height":39}]},{"text":"정점을 반복적으로 탐색합니다. 다음에 나오는 그림을 보면서 BFS 동작에 대해 자세히 알아보겠","words":[{"text":"정점을","x":214,"y":454,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"반복적으로","x":326,"y":455,"width":163,"height":37},{"text":"탐색합니다.","x":502,"y":455,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"다음에","x":691,"y":456,"width":93,"height":38},{"text":"나오는","x":800,"y":456,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"그림을","x":908,"y":457,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"보면서","x":1018,"y":458,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"BFS","x":1130,"y":463,"width":60,"height":28},{"text":"동작에","x":1204,"y":457,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"대해","x":1317,"y":457,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"자세히","x":1393,"y":457,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"알아보겠","x":1509,"y":455,"width":133,"height":40}]},{"text":"습니다.","words":[{"text":"습니다.","x":211,"y":527,"width":108,"height":38}]},{"text":"1. 먼저 시작점인 \u0027우리잡 정점을 방문합니다. 그림 6-3에서 빨간색 점선이 현재 경계를 나타내","words":[{"text":"1.","x":233,"y":635,"width":25,"height":29},{"text":"먼저","x":274,"y":629,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"시작점인","x":351,"y":629,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"\u0027우리잡","x":494,"y":629,"width":111,"height":37},{"text":"정점을","x":619,"y":629,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"방문합니다.","x":730,"y":629,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"그림","x":915,"y":630,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"6-3에서","x":993,"y":631,"width":117,"height":38},{"text":"빨간색","x":1126,"y":630,"width":93,"height":38},{"text":"점선이","x":1236,"y":629,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"현재","x":1348,"y":629,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"경계를","x":1427,"y":630,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"나타내","x":1539,"y":630,"width":98,"height":39}]},{"text":"며, 이 경계와 인접한 정점으로는 RI과 R2가 있습니다.","words":[{"text":"며,","x":272,"y":702,"width":39,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":328,"y":702,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"경계와","x":373,"y":701,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"인접한","x":483,"y":701,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"정점으로는","x":592,"y":702,"width":162,"height":37},{"text":"RI과","x":765,"y":702,"width":75,"height":37},{"text":"R2가","x":850,"y":702,"width":76,"height":38},{"text":"있습니다.","x":938,"y":703,"width":136,"height":39}]},{"text":"그림 6-3 BFS 경계 초기화","words":[{"text":"그림","x":306,"y":813,"width":46,"height":27},{"text":"6-3","x":363,"y":815,"width":47,"height":24},{"text":"BFS","x":423,"y":815,"width":50,"height":24},{"